喝点什么？", "sub": "nǐ xiǎng hē diǎn shén me?", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720003, "front": "Can you help me for a second?", "back": "你可以帮我一下吗？", "sub": "nǐ kě yǐ bāng wǒ yī xià ma?", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720004, "front": "I don't quite understand.", "back": "我不太明白。", "sub": "wǒ bù tài míng bái.", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720005, "front": "Please say it again.", "back": "请再说一遍。", "sub": "qǐng zài shuō yī biàn.", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720006, "front": "Where is the restroom?", "back": "洗手间在哪里？", "sub": "xǐ shǒu jiān zài nǎ lǐ?", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720007, "front": "This is too expensive.", "back": "这个太贵了。", "sub": "zhè ge tài guì le.", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720008, "front": "I don't know.", "back": "我不知道。", "sub": "wǒ bù zhī dào.", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720009, "front": "Where do you live?", "back": "你住在哪里？", "sub": "nǐ zhù zài nǎ lǐ?", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720010, "front": "What are you doing?", "back": "你在做什么？", "sub": "nǐ zài zuò shén me?", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720011, "front": "This is really delicious.", "back": "这个真好吃。", "sub": "zhè ge zhēn hǎo chī.", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720012, "front": "Are you hungry?", "back": "你饿了吗？", "sub": "nǐ è le ma?", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720013, "front": "I'm very busy today.", "back": "我今天很忙。", "sub": "wǒ jīn tiān hěn máng.", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720014, "front": "Wait for me a moment.", "back": "等我一下。", "sub": "děng wǒ yī xià.", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720015, "front": "It's raining outside.", "back": "外面在下雨。", "sub": "wài miàn zài xià yǔ.", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720016, "front": "What's your phone number?", "back": "你的电话号码是多少？", "sub": "nǐ de diàn huà hào mǎ shì duō shǎo?", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720017, "front": "Have a nice weekend!", "back": "周末愉快！", "sub": "zhōu mò yú kuài!", "level": 0, "next": 0}, {"id": 720018, "front": "Do you speak English?", "back": "你会说英语吗？", "sub": "nǐ huì shuō yīng yǔ ma?",